OL,3,GNEWSA'I could never hear on my left
OL,4,Aside - until I got a prosthetic ear'
OL,5,
OL,6,FImagine being born without an ear and
OL,7,Fspending your entire life without being
OL,8,Fable to hear on one side.
OL,10,FStephen Gilbert, 74, from Aghalee, was
OL,11,Fborn with unilateral microtia, a rare
OL,12,Fcondition in which the external ear is
OL,13,Funderdeveloped or missing on one side.
OL,15,FBut he was recently fitted with a
OL,16,Fnewly-designed prosthesis that
OL,17,Faccommodates a hearing aid, allowing
OL,18,Fhim to hear on his left side for the
OL,19,Ffirst time.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
