OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I could never hear on my left
OL,4,Aside - until I got a prosthetic ear'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat's thanks to oral and maxillofacial
OL,7,Fsurgery at the Ulster Hospital; the
OL,8,Fonly service of its kind in Northern
OL,9,FIreland, providing bespoke prostheses
OL,10,Ffor people affected by birth defects,
OL,11,Ftraumatic injuries and cancer surgery.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
